下面Python代码用于在升序lst(list类型)中查找目标值target最后一次出现的位置。相关说法，正确的是()。
```cpp
def binary_search(lst, target):
    if len(lst) == 0:
        return None
    low, high = 0, len(lst)-1
    while low < high:
        mid = (low + high + 1) // 2
        if lst[mid] <= target:
            low = mid
        else:
            high = mid - 1
    return low if lst[low] == target else None
```

